<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>WHILE IT RAINS</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">BACK TO REALITY</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2Bgnt5MdQ7o9zfcsRT067Q</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.646" end="00:10.079">I’ll hold you close while our hairs turning grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.079" end="00:14.987">Every morning, night, and day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.987" end="00:20.167">We'll sit by the window and watch while it rains</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.167" end="00:27.056">No other words will ever explain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.056" end="00:31.853">Stay by me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.853" end="00:37.151">Don't matter what they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.151" end="00:42.381">We'll walk all night long and talk all we want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.381" end="00:47.864">Then drive home while you fall asleep next to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.864" end="00:55.864">I can't believe, I never thought I'd be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.088" end="01:06.088">Next to someone like you, someone like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.196" end="01:14.196">[Instrumental Outro]</p></div></body></tt>